  "summary": "Firewall (dash panel) sound insulation and the underbody splash shields, all models: the LH and RH plenum panel insulators [6]/[1] glued (51e adhesive) along the cowl plenum, the dash mat [2], and the dash insulator [5] with its cover [3], held to the dash panel by push-in fasteners [4] with 53a sealer. The underbody splash shields [7] (inner wheelhouse / kick area, View A) attach at the top with nut [10], rivet [9] and bracket [8]; the lower attachment is on sheet UPC 1 B/W. Perforated areas marked C are removed only on cars with RPO C60 air conditioning.",
